ar</span></td>\n<td align=\"center\">1984–2008 (24)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Generation_Z\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Generation Z\">Generation Z</a></td>\n<td>Artist (Adaptive)</td>\n<td align=\"center\">2001–2023 (22)</td>\n<td>4th Turning: Crisis: <span class=\"new\" title=\"Great Recession (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvR3JlYXRfUmVjZXNzaW9uP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Great Recession</span>, <span class=\"new\" title=\"War on Terror (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvV2FyX29uX1RlcnJvcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">War on Terror</span>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Great_Reset\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Great Reset\">The Great Reset</a> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Flood\" title=\"The Flood\">The Flood</a></td>\n<td align=\"center\">2008-2033 (25)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">Great Reset Saeculum (~100 years)\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">Gig Economy 2028-2080 (52 years)\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"new\" title=\"Generation (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvR2VuZXJhdGlvbj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Flood Generation</span></td>\n<td>Prophet (Idealist)</td>\n<td align=\"center\">2024-2047 (23)</td>\n<td>1st Turning: High: <a href=\"/wiki/Seventh_Party_System\" title=\"Seventh Party System\">Renewal</a></td>\n<td align=\"center\">2033–2051 (18)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"new\" title=\"Generation (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvR2VuZXJhdGlvbj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Missing Generation</span></td>\n<td>Nomad (Reactive)</td>\n<td align=\"center\">2048-2074 (26)</td>\n<td>2nd Turning: Awakening: <a href=\"/wiki/World_War_III\" title=\"World War III\">World War III</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Refreeze\" title=\"The Refreeze\">The Refreeze</a></td>\n<td align=\"center\">2051–2077 (26)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">Neo-feudal Economy 2080-2128 (48 years)\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"n